{{!-- ── ONBOARDING HUB ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  Modular setup path. The customer selects the products in their workspace;
  the inline script at the bottom shows the matching blocks, numbers them,
  and keeps the selection in the URL (?products=inventory,crew,qi).

  Product keys: inventory, crew, organize, qi (Quoting & Invoicing),
  tracking (Equipment Tracking, requires inventory). Platform is always shown.

  Conditional content inside a block: data-rm-show="<expr>", where <expr> is
  one or more product keys joined by & (and), each optionally prefixed with !
  (not). Example: data-rm-show="inventory&!crew". With no selection, every
  product counts as selected, so the page shows the full path.

  Without JavaScript the page shows every block in the default order.
──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── --}}

